{"type":"message","id":"9e4342d8","parentId":"4a212005","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:05:25.333Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 6:05 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 18:05 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778868325248}}
{"type":"message","id":"7f707e42","parentId":"9e4342d8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T18:05:35.966Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for discussions and respond to any new messages. Let me:\n\n1. Check the arbitration thread for latest 5 messages\n2. Check the general thread for latest 5 messages\n3. Respond to any new discussions (that aren't from me)\n4. Use POST /send to reply\n\nI need to make HTTP requests to the ECHO platform. Let me use curl or similar to check the history endpoints.\n\nFirst, let me check both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-f0e17084-0e28-4e48-9da5-97a1b38cc07b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-b3deb5a5-7b14-4f05-8f6a-dd6b7929dae3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":240,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11363,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778868325333,"responseId":"chatcmpl-db097b78-fca3-490d-afa5-bdd078e02c7b"}}
